WEBVTT

00:01:13.550 --> 00:01:17.060
<i>Where are you wandering, my Joe?</i>

00:01:17.060 --> 00:01:19.800
<i>Even though they call us the scum of society,</i>

00:01:19.800 --> 00:01:21.850
<i>you and I have clung to boxing,</i>

00:01:21.850 --> 00:01:25.720
<i>and worked hard to crawl out of our bog and seek our tomorrow!</i>

00:01:25.720 --> 00:01:29.320
<i>But Joe, is there no more tomorrow for us?</i>

00:01:29.320 --> 00:01:32.520
<i>Come back to the gym as soon as you can!</i>

00:02:14.200 --> 00:02:15.360
Joe...

00:02:21.740 --> 00:02:22.120
J-Joe!

00:02:22.120 --> 00:02:23.450
J-Joe!

00:02:23.910 --> 00:02:24.660
It's Joe!

00:02:24.660 --> 00:02:25.830
Bro Joe?

00:02:25.830 --> 00:02:27.500
He came back?

00:02:27.500 --> 00:02:30.990
Can't you guys hear Joe whistling?

00:02:30.990 --> 00:02:34.410
He's come back to my gym!

00:02:34.410 --> 00:02:35.790
Joe!

00:02:35.790 --> 00:02:36.710
Old man...

00:02:36.710 --> 00:02:44.600
Joe!

00:02:49.410 --> 00:02:50.480
Hey!

00:02:50.480 --> 00:02:51.270
Joe!

00:03:08.500 --> 00:03:11.790
You must be pretty tired, old man.

00:03:12.250 --> 00:03:16.280
You haven't had a wink of sleep since Joe left.

00:03:16.280 --> 00:03:18.680
That ain't good for you. You better rest up.

00:03:18.680 --> 00:03:20.050
Joe... My Joe...

00:03:20.050 --> 00:03:21.760
Joe... My Joe...

00:03:37.230 --> 00:03:38.440
It's a fight! A fight!

00:03:38.440 --> 00:03:39.690
It's a fight! A fight!

00:03:40.320 --> 00:03:41.550
Move!

00:03:41.550 --> 00:03:43.470
It's a fight!

00:03:44.330 --> 00:03:46.330
There's some real yakuza fighting

00:03:46.330 --> 00:03:49.090
in front of a theater showing a yakuza movie!

00:03:56.440 --> 00:03:59.530
Hey, punks! You think you can fuck with the Denpo family?

00:03:59.530 --> 00:04:01.090
I hope you know what's comin' to ya!

00:04:01.430 --> 00:04:06.890
We spilled a lotta blood making clear this was our turf!

00:04:07.380 --> 00:04:10.890
But here you are, swaggering around like you fucking own the place!

00:04:11.770 --> 00:04:16.630
We're swaggering around 'cause we got the juice to do just that.

00:04:16.630 --> 00:04:17.860
That's a good one.{split next sentence from this one - ninja}

00:04:17.860 --> 00:04:19.860
Mind telling us why?

00:04:19.860 --> 00:04:22.980
Listen up real good. Our family...

00:04:22.980 --> 00:04:26.870
...Just hired a real badass thug!

00:04:26.870 --> 00:04:28.240
What's that?

00:04:28.240 --> 00:04:30.500
Hey, Crew Boss! You're up!

00:04:41.120 --> 00:04:45.010
Wh-Who the fuck is this?

00:04:46.920 --> 00:04:50.300
Let him get a good look at your face, Boss.

00:04:55.440 --> 00:04:57.900
You think that ugly mug is gonna scare me?

00:04:57.900 --> 00:05:02.050
I guess the Denpo family is full of dumbasses with no memory.

00:05:02.050 --> 00:05:04.150
Have you forgotten the former All-Japan bantamweight rookie champion,

00:05:04.150 --> 00:05:08.450
the guy they said was gonna make it to the world championships, Wolf Kanagushi?

00:05:10.120 --> 00:05:11.300
Wolf Kanagushi?

00:05:12.100 --> 00:05:13.500
That's the real Kanagushi!

00:05:13.500 --> 00:05:16.710
I heard Yabuki broke his jaw and he retired!

00:05:15.410 --> 00:05:18.650
<i>I'd never have imagined he'd stoop so low as to be a yakuza bodyguard!{}{}{}{}{}{}</i>

00:05:18.650 --> 00:05:21.930
And to think he could've been the world champion...

00:05:25.010 --> 00:05:26.720
Hey, hey, hey, hey!

00:05:26.720 --> 00:05:30.900
Looks like you ain't got shit to say now that you know Crew Boss Wolf is running with us!

00:05:30.900 --> 00:05:35.640
Well? What's it gonna be, Mr. Denpo Boss?

00:05:34.480 --> 00:05:35.640
<i>Fuck...</i>

00:05:37.640 --> 00:05:39.130
Fuck you... and fuck your Wolf!

00:05:39.130 --> 00:05:40.720
Fuck you... and fuck your Wolf!

00:05:42.700 --> 00:05:45.940
I don't give a shit if he used to be a boxer
 <i>or</i> a prospective world champion!

00:05:45.940 --> 00:05:48.160
I got a weapon right here!

00:05:51.200 --> 00:05:52.160
You wanna fight?

00:05:52.160 --> 00:05:53.120
The hell...

00:05:53.120 --> 00:05:56.500
We'll fucking... kill you...

00:06:03.370 --> 00:06:04.640
Getting your knives out, huh?

00:06:04.640 --> 00:06:08.880
I hope you know that a first-rate boxer's fist is twice as fast as the average man's.

00:06:08.880 --> 00:06:12.810
On top of that, I don't see how you're gonna use those knives with those shaky hands of yours.

00:06:13.270 --> 00:06:18.200
I figure I can break your ribs and kill you before you can cut me.

00:06:18.200 --> 00:06:20.350
Sound good? Then bring it!

00:06:20.350 --> 00:06:22.530
Oh, shit...

00:06:23.380 --> 00:06:25.530
If you won't bring it, then I will!

00:06:25.530 --> 00:06:26.280
Fuck!

00:06:26.280 --> 00:06:26.740
We gotta run!

00:06:27.200 --> 00:06:28.340
You goddamn...

00:06:54.530 --> 00:06:56.180
Boss...

00:06:57.400 --> 00:07:01.190
The hell was that? You didn't stand a chance, not even with a knife!

00:07:01.890 --> 00:07:04.800
Goddammit! We'll get you back for this!

00:07:04.800 --> 00:07:05.930
This ain't over, fuckers!

00:07:05.930 --> 00:07:06.320
Outta the way!

00:07:08.230 --> 00:07:10.700
What, is talking shit the best you can do?

00:07:10.700 --> 00:07:13.200
Come back when you're ready for a real fight!

00:07:15.580 --> 00:07:17.790
Good work, Crew Boss Wolf.

00:07:22.830 --> 00:07:23.790
Come on, out of our way!

00:07:23.790 --> 00:07:26.720
What're you looking at? Move!

00:07:29.830 --> 00:07:31.280
Well, that was easy.

00:07:31.280 --> 00:07:33.270
They just rolled over when they saw our boss here.

00:07:40.930 --> 00:07:41.610
We're goin' upstairs!

00:07:41.610 --> 00:07:42.230
Wel-Welcome, sirs...

00:07:42.230 --> 00:07:43.700
Wel-Welcome, sirs...

00:07:51.970 --> 00:07:55.380
The fuck is everybody gawkin' at?

00:07:55.380 --> 00:07:57.370
Hey, what's your problem?

00:07:57.370 --> 00:08:00.380
Hey, go get us some beers! Huh? That's right.

00:08:00.380 --> 00:08:01.910
We're gonna drink the night away!

00:08:04.670 --> 00:08:06.290
That's what they get!

00:08:10.720 --> 00:08:14.470
Yeah, that was really bitchin' when Boss Wolf got the drop on them.

00:08:15.620 --> 00:08:18.510
I don't blame 'em for turning chicken!

00:08:18.850 --> 00:08:22.890
No shit! Our crew boss here once had a ten-count showdown{tlc - what is a 'counter showdown'}

00:08:22.890 --> 00:08:25.540
with Yabuki Joe, the Rikiishi-killer!

00:08:25.540 --> 00:08:26.780
You got that right!

00:08:26.780 --> 00:08:30.670
That one match was enough to make the name "Wolf Kanagushi"

00:08:30.670 --> 00:08:32.400
remembered for all time! Right?

00:08:32.400 --> 00:08:33.530
Yeah, you got that right!

00:08:34.250 --> 00:08:37.060
Now, about my match with Yabuki Joe...

00:08:37.060 --> 00:08:39.550
If I just got another go at him,

00:08:39.550 --> 00:08:41.500
I could've knocked him out!

00:08:41.500 --> 00:08:43.290
Yeah, of course!

00:08:43.290 --> 00:08:44.500
Th-That's true.

00:08:45.000 --> 00:08:48.580
Forget Japan-I could've become the world champion!

00:08:48.580 --> 00:08:51.510
Hear me? The world champion!

00:08:52.340 --> 00:08:53.670
World champion?

00:08:53.670 --> 00:08:57.600
When you put it that way, we really ain't even worthy to even talk to ya!

00:08:57.600 --> 00:08:59.280
That's impressive!

00:09:07.380 --> 00:09:08.650
Welcome, sir.

00:09:20.280 --> 00:09:23.370
Your punches are the best I've ever seen, Boss!

00:09:23.370 --> 00:09:25.520
Thanks to you, we own this town!

00:09:25.520 --> 00:09:28.110
We'll be expectin' a lot outta ya!

00:09:28.110 --> 00:09:30.040
Sure would love to have another go at Yabuki.

00:09:30.040 --> 00:09:33.680
Dammit, if only I'd stepped in a centimeter further...

00:09:33.680 --> 00:09:37.820
Yabuki would've been on the floor before he could throw his Triple Cross!

00:09:38.550 --> 00:09:42.140
That one centimeter ruined all my glory!

00:09:47.690 --> 00:09:49.560
If he hadn't got me there,

00:09:49.560 --> 00:09:52.910
I could've fought Joe again and knocked him out!

00:09:57.980 --> 00:10:00.150
Listen, the point is...

00:10:00.150 --> 00:10:05.660
In my boxing life, Yabuki was just a pebble I tripped over the wrong way.

00:10:05.660 --> 00:10:08.450
You're such a tragic boxer, Boss.

00:10:08.450 --> 00:10:10.200
That's real unlucky.

00:10:10.200 --> 00:10:11.180
Unlucky?

00:10:11.180 --> 00:10:13.630
Wolf, now that you say it,

00:10:13.630 --> 00:10:16.290
we're both tragic boxers who've lost our way.

00:10:16.290 --> 00:10:18.180
We've both fallen from great heights.

00:10:21.260 --> 00:10:21.880
The fuck?

00:10:21.880 --> 00:10:23.310
Wh-Who the hell are you?

00:10:24.600 --> 00:10:27.120
Hey. You really did a number on us back there.

00:10:27.120 --> 00:10:29.140
So we've come to pay you our proper respects.

00:10:29.140 --> 00:10:31.230
Hope you ain't goin' anywhere.

00:10:31.540 --> 00:10:32.780
Say that again...

00:10:32.780 --> 00:10:37.240
Well, look who's come back after turning tail earlier tonight!

00:10:37.240 --> 00:10:39.860
We can't have you fucking around on our turf.

00:10:39.860 --> 00:10:41.740
We got a reputation to keep up.

00:10:41.740 --> 00:10:47.250
So if you've hired Wolf Kanagushi as your bodyguard, we'll just have to match you.

00:10:47.250 --> 00:10:51.250
Gondo-san the Brawler, the room's all yours!

00:10:52.450 --> 00:10:54.220
Gondo the Brawler?

00:11:01.220 --> 00:11:03.220
Pardon the interruption.

00:11:28.640 --> 00:11:32.540
Why don't we have a little test and see how my brawling style

00:11:32.540 --> 00:11:35.040
matches up to your orthodox boxing?

00:11:36.040 --> 00:11:38.540
I don't give a fuck if you're a brawler or a bowler!

00:11:38.540 --> 00:11:40.590
You must be crazy, wanting to take on Crew Boss Wolf.

00:11:42.970 --> 00:11:44.610
I doubt I'll match up to him,

00:11:44.610 --> 00:11:48.670
but I knew the risks when I took on my duties as a fellow bodyguard.

00:11:48.670 --> 00:11:50.780
Come on, Wolf-san. Stand up.

00:11:52.550 --> 00:11:53.640
Fine by me.

00:11:59.270 --> 00:12:00.870
No holds barred, all right?

00:12:00.870 --> 00:12:02.860
Come at me any way you like, Gondo-san.

00:12:16.050 --> 00:12:16.880
What's the matter?

00:12:16.880 --> 00:12:19.380
What happened to all your bravado?

00:12:22.260 --> 00:12:22.760
Gondo-san...

00:12:22.760 --> 00:12:24.090
Oh, shit...

00:12:28.730 --> 00:12:30.350
That's the way, Boss!

00:12:29.130 --> 00:12:30.350
<i>Give 'im hell!</i>

00:12:35.060 --> 00:12:35.450
Wolf!

00:12:48.210 --> 00:12:49.800
B-Boss...

00:12:52.360 --> 00:12:54.100
I ain't done with you yet!

00:13:18.420 --> 00:13:20.070
I-I think that's enough, Gondo-san.

00:13:20.660 --> 00:13:22.940
O-Our crew boss's gonna get killed!

00:13:28.460 --> 00:13:30.700
You trying to kill Wolf, Brawler?

00:13:33.230 --> 00:13:36.530
He's already down for the count. Give it a rest!

00:13:38.710 --> 00:13:41.710
And who the fuck are you?

00:13:42.120 --> 00:13:43.590
Doesn't matter who I am.

00:13:43.590 --> 00:13:46.600
Lay one more finger on Wolf, and you'll have to answer to me!

00:13:46.600 --> 00:13:48.720
Got that, you dumbass?

00:13:55.650 --> 00:13:57.570
Hey! You guys in the corner!

00:13:57.570 --> 00:13:59.170
What're you just standing there for?

00:13:59.170 --> 00:14:02.860
You better get Wolf to a hospital, or his jaw won't heal!

00:14:05.680 --> 00:14:06.240
Boss!

00:14:06.240 --> 00:14:07.860
Boss! Hang in there!

00:14:07.860 --> 00:14:10.440
You! Carry his head and shoulders!

00:14:10.440 --> 00:14:11.270
Boss...

00:14:11.270 --> 00:14:11.650
Boss...

00:14:11.650 --> 00:14:13.750
S-Stop squirming, Boss...

00:14:13.750 --> 00:14:14.830
Boss!

00:14:20.210 --> 00:14:21.910
Hey there, chief.

00:14:21.910 --> 00:14:23.340
You must be a real wiseguy, huh?

00:14:23.340 --> 00:14:26.250
Stop! You two stay out of this!

00:14:26.250 --> 00:14:27.340
Don't lay a hand on him.

00:14:27.340 --> 00:14:29.840
B-But Gondo-san...

00:14:29.840 --> 00:14:31.430
Cut it out!

00:14:31.430 --> 00:14:34.850
Do you want this guy to kill you or something?

00:14:36.650 --> 00:14:41.860
You guys couldn't take on that kid even if you ganged up on him ten-on-one.

00:14:44.110 --> 00:14:46.800
Why? Why do you assume that?

00:14:48.410 --> 00:14:50.360
Brawling's my business, kid.

00:14:50.360 --> 00:14:52.870
I can tell if someone's strong or not at a single glance.

00:14:53.530 --> 00:14:56.370
You're a boxer, aren't ya?

00:14:58.650 --> 00:15:01.880
I think your name was Yabuki Joe...

00:15:04.420 --> 00:15:05.430
Yabuki?

00:15:05.430 --> 00:15:06.880
J-Joe?

00:15:10.580 --> 00:15:13.600
No, I ain't got a chance against ya.

00:15:13.600 --> 00:15:16.390
And I refuse to brawl if I ain't got a chance.

00:15:19.440 --> 00:15:21.150
Then why'd you fight back there?

00:15:21.150 --> 00:15:24.400
Are you saying you thought you could beat Wolf, who was a boxer like me?

00:15:25.820 --> 00:15:27.980
Yeah, I didn't think I'd lose.

00:15:27.980 --> 00:15:29.910
Wh-Why not, huh?

00:15:29.910 --> 00:15:32.180
Leaving aside the fact that you ended up winning...

00:15:32.180 --> 00:15:36.760
This guy and Wolf went punch-for-punch,
 and you beat the shit out of him!

00:15:36.760 --> 00:15:39.370
Th-That's right! It's not like Yabuki-

00:15:38.360 --> 00:15:39.370
<i>Fuckin' idiots!</i>

00:15:40.310 --> 00:15:43.650
There's a difference between a former boxer and an active one.

00:15:44.680 --> 00:15:46.480
But I'm not active anymore, just like Wolf.

00:15:46.480 --> 00:15:47.460
But I'm not active anymore, just like Wolf.

00:15:50.470 --> 00:15:52.650
Oh, really?

00:15:52.650 --> 00:15:55.180
I didn't know that.

00:15:55.180 --> 00:15:56.810
But you're different.

00:15:57.430 --> 00:15:59.350
How am I different?

00:15:59.350 --> 00:16:00.350
Tell me!

00:16:00.940 --> 00:16:03.850
It's your eyes. They ain't like Wolf's.

00:16:05.980 --> 00:16:08.270
When you've been in the business as long as I have,{split because it's 3-lines - ninja}

00:16:08.270 --> 00:16:11.340
you can guess at someone's strength by their eyes.

00:16:11.340 --> 00:16:14.370
And yours burn like the eyes of a tiger.

00:16:15.190 --> 00:16:18.150
I don't brawl with people that have eyes like yours.

00:16:18.150 --> 00:16:20.580
Cause I know I don't stand a chance.

00:16:20.580 --> 00:16:26.580
But on the other hand, that Wolf had sunken eyes, like a rotten fish.

00:16:27.010 --> 00:16:31.680
When I saw the pitiful eyes of a man weeping and clinging to his former glory,

00:16:31.680 --> 00:16:34.110
I figured that I wouldn't lose.

00:16:38.350 --> 00:16:39.980
I don't like it.

00:16:39.980 --> 00:16:42.650
If you knew you'd win,

00:16:42.650 --> 00:16:44.560
why'd you have to go so far?

00:16:45.900 --> 00:16:48.860
I really hate those types.

00:16:51.110 --> 00:16:54.950
I guess you could say they make me sick...

00:17:01.380 --> 00:17:03.860
I dare you to say one more thing about Wolf!

00:17:03.860 --> 00:17:05.670
You'll pay for it!

00:17:14.220 --> 00:17:17.300
Th-That was beautiful. You've got a great punch.

00:17:17.300 --> 00:17:22.810
Y-You're the real deal. This is how a boxer's punch has gotta be.

00:17:32.820 --> 00:17:35.150
Shit! Someone called the pigs!

00:17:35.150 --> 00:17:37.080
W-We gotta split!

00:17:55.600 --> 00:17:57.220
Hey, uh, Boss!

00:17:57.220 --> 00:17:58.480
Boss Joe!

00:17:59.770 --> 00:18:02.900
Forgive my rudeness! I almost didn't recognize you.

00:18:06.020 --> 00:18:08.350
Hey, show some goddamn respect!

00:18:08.350 --> 00:18:10.820
Who the hell do you think this guy is?

00:18:10.820 --> 00:18:12.320
He's the great Yabuki Joe!

00:18:12.810 --> 00:18:14.530
Y-Yabuki?

00:18:14.530 --> 00:18:15.450
Joe?

00:18:15.450 --> 00:18:17.320
The guy that killed Rikiishi?

00:18:17.320 --> 00:18:18.930
Damn straight!

00:18:18.930 --> 00:18:23.000
The wild killer, the great Yabuki Joe, here in the flesh!

00:18:24.290 --> 00:18:24.870
Right?

00:18:27.830 --> 00:18:32.130
Hey, Boss, why don't you tell us all a story to pass the time?

00:18:32.130 --> 00:18:35.300
Tell us the heroic story about how you killed Rikiishi!

00:18:38.600 --> 00:18:40.350
Hey, don't you guys wanna hear it?

00:18:40.350 --> 00:18:42.220
Come on, you gotta beg him for it!

00:18:42.220 --> 00:18:44.850
What're you waiting for? Beg him!

00:18:44.850 --> 00:18:46.060
Please...

00:18:46.060 --> 00:18:48.020
Let us hear it, just once...

00:18:48.020 --> 00:18:51.810
We'd love to hear it, Boss Yabuki.

00:18:51.820 --> 00:18:53.150
Please.

00:18:53.150 --> 00:18:54.860
Please, Boss?

00:19:07.220 --> 00:19:09.870
Old man! Dinner's ready!

00:19:14.130 --> 00:19:15.220
Old man...

00:19:18.380 --> 00:19:19.140
<i>Tange-san!</i>

00:19:19.890 --> 00:19:21.520
Tange-san! What are you doing here?

00:19:21.520 --> 00:19:24.140
Don't you have to go see Yabuki-kun?

00:19:26.690 --> 00:19:28.770
What? Did you find Joe?

00:19:29.810 --> 00:19:32.030
You mean you haven't heard yet?

00:19:32.030 --> 00:19:34.280
D-Did they find Joe?

00:19:34.280 --> 00:19:36.270
Wh-Where is he?

00:19:36.270 --> 00:19:40.330
Well, Yabuki got in a fight with some gangsters at a bar in Ikebukuro,

00:19:40.330 --> 00:19:42.280
and he's been taken into custody by the police.

00:19:42.600 --> 00:19:43.510
What?

00:19:43.510 --> 00:19:44.780
J-Joe's in custody?

00:19:45.100 --> 00:19:47.960
W-Was he all right? Was he hurt?

00:19:47.960 --> 00:19:49.440
W-Was he all right? Was he hurt?

00:19:49.440 --> 00:19:50.620
H-He's fine...

00:19:50.620 --> 00:19:53.630
After all, his fists were lethal weapons back there.

00:19:53.630 --> 00:19:55.130
Lethal weapons?

00:19:56.220 --> 00:19:57.880
That's what we said!

00:19:57.880 --> 00:20:00.680
The gangsters' bodyguard had his internal organs ruptured.

00:20:00.680 --> 00:20:03.010
It'll take him three weeks to recover!

00:20:03.010 --> 00:20:04.060
Old man...

00:20:04.640 --> 00:20:08.230
I see... So his punches are a deadly weapon...

00:20:09.270 --> 00:20:11.320
Joe's punches are a deadly weapon?

00:20:12.020 --> 00:20:15.400
He's still alive! He's alive!

00:20:16.070 --> 00:20:19.450
How d'ya like that? Joe's still alive!

00:20:37.340 --> 00:20:41.340
<i>If only I'd stepped in a centimeter further...</i>

00:20:41.340 --> 00:20:42.570
<i>I wouldn't have lost.</i>

00:20:42.570 --> 00:20:45.060
<i>I would've been the world champion by now!</i>

00:20:54.110 --> 00:20:59.030
<i>I saw the pitiful eyes of a man weeping and clinging to his former glory...</i>

00:20:59.030 --> 00:21:01.450
<i>I really hate those types.</i>

00:21:01.450 --> 00:21:04.410
<i>You could say they make me sick.</i>

00:21:05.570 --> 00:21:08.550
<i>You shouldn't be happy-go-lucky enough to drink and moan here!</i>

00:21:08.550 --> 00:21:10.780
<i>You can't do your duty as a man like this, can you?</i>

00:21:10.780 --> 00:21:12.640
<i>You're in debt to them both.</i>

00:21:12.640 --> 00:21:14.820
<i>A sacred liability.</i>

00:21:14.820 --> 00:21:16.990
<i>And you need to realize that right now!</i>

00:21:16.990 --> 00:21:20.580
<i>For Wolf-kun, and for Rikiishi-kun!</i>

00:21:20.580 --> 00:21:24.560
Rikiishi, what am I...

00:21:24.560 --> 00:21:26.710
<i>It's your eyes. They ain't like Wolf's.</i>

00:21:26.710 --> 00:21:29.260
<i>Yours burn like the eyes of a tiger.</i>

00:21:46.730 --> 00:21:50.700
<i>You have a sacred liability to Rikiishi-kun and to Wolf-kun.</i>

00:21:50.700 --> 00:21:52.310
<i>A sacred liability... A sacred liability...</i>

00:21:52.310 --> 00:21:54.250
<i>A sacred liability... A sacred liability...</i>

00:21:54.250 --> 00:21:56.040
Rikiishi...

00:21:56.040 --> 00:22:00.930
I'm jealous of Wolf for being able to live by clinging to his memories.

00:22:00.930 --> 00:22:02.880
If I could, I would live like Wolf.

00:22:02.880 --> 00:22:09.180
I would have lived as I chose, with nothing but my memories of you, Rikiishi.

00:22:09.180 --> 00:22:15.050
No-I thought of doing just that countless times after you died.

00:22:15.050 --> 00:22:16.270
But Rikiishi...

00:22:16.770 --> 00:22:17.810
I...

00:22:19.180 --> 00:22:20.730
I...!

00:22:30.800 --> 00:22:32.120
I... I... can't live like Wolf!

00:22:32.120 --> 00:22:33.270
I... I... can't live like Wolf!

00:22:33.270 --> 00:22:35.290
I... I... can't live like Wolf!

00:22:53.730 --> 00:22:55.260
Yabuki Joe, you're out.

00:23:01.030 --> 00:23:03.770
So you're getting out already, Boss Joe?

00:23:04.750 --> 00:23:05.780
Hey.

00:23:08.080 --> 00:23:12.810
If you ever see Wolf, don't tell him about me.

00:23:12.810 --> 00:23:15.660
He needs to live in his own happy world.

00:23:20.310 --> 00:23:21.600
Farewell, Wolf.

00:23:22.380 --> 00:23:24.490
I don't know how to say this right...

00:23:24.490 --> 00:23:28.540
but I just can't live on memories alone.

00:23:53.660 --> 00:23:56.700
Yuke kouya wo

00:23:53.660 --> 00:23:56.700
Go to the wilderness!

00:23:57.790 --> 00:24:00.540
Oira boxer

00:23:57.790 --> 00:24:00.540
I am a boxer.

00:24:01.330 --> 00:24:08.300
Yuuhi ga giragira otoko no yume wa

00:24:01.330 --> 00:24:08.300
The evening sun glitters upon the dreams of men!

00:24:10.010 --> 00:24:13.970
Minna wa kono ore wo nasakemuyo to iu

00:24:10.010 --> 00:24:13.970
Everyone says that I am merciless.

00:24:13.970 --> 00:24:16.300
Tsuki ni hoete hitori

00:24:13.970 --> 00:24:16.300
Howling at the moon alone.

00:24:18.060 --> 00:24:22.520
Oyanashi yadonashi no na mo nai boxer wa

00:24:18.060 --> 00:24:22.520
A parentless, homeless, nameless boxer

00:24:22.520 --> 00:24:25.520
Kusari wo kamikitta Yeah Yeah!

00:24:22.520 --> 00:24:25.520
has bitten off his chains! Yeah, yeah!

00:24:26.940 --> 00:24:29.860
Yuke kouya wo

00:24:26.940 --> 00:24:29.860
Go to the wilderness!

00:24:30.900 --> 00:24:33.570
Oira boxer

00:24:30.900 --> 00:24:33.570
I am a boxer.

00:24:34.700 --> 00:24:41.830
Asahi ga noboru yo otoko no mune ni {removed the Woo, but otherwise japanese is unchanged - Reed}

00:24:34.700 --> 00:24:41.830
The morning sun rises upon the hearts of men!

00:24:44.820 --> 00:24:46.360
Joe's eyes shine.

00:24:46.360 --> 00:24:48.340
His fighting blood boils.

00:24:48.340 --> 00:24:50.590
For Rikiishi and for himself,

00:24:50.910 --> 00:24:53.700
Joe tries to stand up again!

00:24:53.700 --> 00:24:55.590
He fiercely declares his comeback!

00:24:56.440 --> 00:24:59.100
One punch, two punches, three punches!

00:24:59.100 --> 00:25:02.480
His new determination bursts upon the sandbag!

00:25:02.480 --> 00:25:06.680
Now, as Joe once again stakes his life on the ring,

00:25:06.680 --> 00:25:08.060
which way is tomorrow!?
